{"source":"Gori - Single-session photon-counting CT protocol for simultaneous screening of coronary and carotid artery.pdf","page":4,"pageWidth":595.276,"pageHeight":793.701,"items":[{"text":"disease with suspected","rect":[36.8503,273.091022,122.36439393999999,281.59092200000003],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"\u2265","rect":[124.3227709,273.091022,130.1452024,281.59092200000003],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"50% stenosis or ulcerated plaque prompts","rect":[130.1452024,273.091022,285.83617072,281.59092200000003],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"Doppler ultrasound and vascular consultation; aortic diameters","rect":[36.85029999999999,263.57113400000003,285.81492097,272.07103400000005],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"meeting pre-specified thresholds prompt vascular referral and sur","rect":[36.85029999999999,254.10224540000002,282.62065855000003,262.60214540000004],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"-","rect":[282.6207,254.09972199999999,285.7826628,262.599622],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"veillance. Suspected breast lesions on the delayed cardiac phase","rect":[36.8503,244.575522,285.8072710599999,253.075422],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"are referred to specialist examination. Thyroid nodules are referred","rect":[36.8503,235.1066334,285.83192076999995,243.6065334],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"for dedicated ultrasound when","rect":[36.8503,225.58674539999998,155.12895847,234.08664539999998],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"\u2265","rect":[158.568868,225.58674539999998,164.3912995,234.08664539999998],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"1 cm or when imaging suggests","rect":[164.3912995,225.5850809,285.80557108,234.0849809],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"high-risk morphology. Adrenal nodules","rect":[36.85029999999999,216.1161923,188.99851,224.6160923],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"\u2265","rect":[193.9454518,216.1161923,199.7678833,224.6160923],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"1 cm are referred for","rect":[199.7678833,216.1161923,285.79962115000006,224.6160923],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"adrenal-protocol CT or magnetic resonance imaging and endocrine","rect":[36.850300000000004,206.59630429999999,285.8344707399999,215.09620429999998],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"assessment. Solid or enhancing renal masses are referred to urology,","rect":[36.850300000000004,197.07641629999998,285.7868712999999,205.57631629999997],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"while hepatic lesions with non-cystic features are referred to hepa","rect":[36.850300000000004,187.60752769999996,282.6368083599999,196.10742769999996],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"-","rect":[282.6368,187.599022,285.7987628,196.098922],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"tology. Findings judged definitively benign (e.g. simple cysts, benign","rect":[36.8503,178.074922,285.80897104,186.57482199999998],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"bone islands, calcified granulomas) do not prompt further testing. All","rect":[36.8503,168.60603339999997,285.8013211299999,177.10593339999997],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"referrals and follow-up actions are communicated to the GP; the","rect":[36.8503,159.08614539999996,285.82342087000006,167.58604539999996],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"study team is available for clarification or re-evaluation as needed.","rect":[36.8503,149.61725679999995,284.84848233999986,158.11715679999995],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"To address cost-effectiveness and potential over-medicalization,","rect":[45.3536,140.090522,285.82767086,148.590422],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"we will conduct a pre-specified economic evaluation comparing the","rect":[36.8537,130.62163339999998,285.82682087,139.12153339999998],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"single-session PCCT strategy with usual care (separate, indication-","rect":[36.8537,121.10174539999997,285.79112129,129.60164539999997],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"based","rect":[36.8537,111.57335749999997,58.7664422,120.07325749999997],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"pathways,","rect":[64.12222919000001,111.57335749999997,101.81078579000001,120.07325749999997],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"and","rect":[107.15212295,111.57335749999997,120.87946145000001,120.07325749999997],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"standard","rect":[126.25734818000001,111.57335749999997,158.79496538,120.07325749999997],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"screening","rect":[164.12780264,111.57335749999997,199.88688194000002,120.07325749999997],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"programmes)","rect":[205.22991908000006,111.57335749999997,254.07884438000008,120.07325749999997],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"over","rect":[259.42783145000004,111.57335749999997,276.21513395000005,120.07325749999997],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"a","rect":[281.59472066000006,111.57335749999997,285.81917096000006,120.07325749999997],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"5-year horizon.","rect":[36.8537,102.10446889999997,93.60498233,110.60436889999997],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"Here we report a preliminary analysis from 11 January 2025 to 21","rect":[45.3536,92.582922,285.7817713999998,101.082822],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"June 2025; enrolment will continue until 560 participants have","rect":[36.8537,83.1140334,285.7732714999999,91.6139334],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"undergone PCCT (anticipated completion November 2026). The pri","rect":[36.8537,73.5941454,282.65295820999984,82.0940454],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"-","rect":[282.6496,73.590722,285.81156280000005,82.090622],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"mary endpoint is the prevalence of obstructive (","rect":[36.8503,64.122722,226.99816294000004,72.62262199999999],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"\u2265","rect":[227.0015629,64.1209805,232.8239944,72.6208805],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"50% stenosis)","rect":[232.8239944,64.1209805,285.81407098,72.6208805],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"and/or extensive (","rect":[36.850300000000004,54.6010925,105.84653827000001,63.100992500000004],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"\u2265","rect":[105.84653827000001,54.6010925,111.66896977000002,63.100992500000004],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"2-vessel) CAD. Sample size was calculated for","rect":[111.66896977000002,54.6010925,285.79877116,63.100992500000004],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"an expected 50% prevalence with 95% confidence and a 4% margin","rect":[303.81515920000004,273.091022,552.75683044,281.59092200000003],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"of error. The study is funded by Fondazione Pisa and approved by","rect":[303.81515920000004,263.57113400000003,552.77043028,272.07103400000005],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"the Ethics Committee of Pisa (ID 26 533). All participants provide","rect":[303.81515920000004,254.10224540000002,552.76193038,262.60214540000004],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"written informed consent prior to enrolment.","rect":[303.81515920000004,244.5823574,472.4310754600001,253.0822574],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"PCCT scan","rect":[303.817,217.892044,359.17473724,229.391844],"fontSize":11.4998},{"text":"Technical details are summarized in","rect":[303.817,206.533022,436.5131888500001,215.03292199999999],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"Table 1","rect":[438.9144106,206.533022,465.72819514,215.03292199999999],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":". All examinations were","rect":[465.72819514,206.533022,552.7391214700001,215.03292199999999],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"performed","rect":[303.817,197.01313399999998,343.3075354,205.51303399999998],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"on","rect":[352.0054830700001,197.01313399999998,361.5678705700001,205.51303399999998],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"a","rect":[370.25986831000006,197.01313399999998,374.48431861000006,205.51303399999998],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"dual-source","rect":[383.18566624000005,197.01313399999998,426.96865114,205.51303399999998],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"photon-counting","rect":[435.6835986100001,197.01313399999998,498.4128606100001,205.51303399999998],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"CT","rect":[507.0589588900001,197.01313399999998,517.76033299,205.51303399999998],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"system","rect":[526.50418012,197.01313399999998,552.78587092,205.51303399999998],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"(Naeotom Alpha; Siemens Healthineers\u00ae) with cadmium-telluride","rect":[303.817,187.54424539999997,552.7782210099999,196.04414539999996],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"detectors","rect":[303.817,178.02435739999996,339.3125824,186.52425739999995],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"and","rect":[345.25911243999997,178.02435739999996,358.98645093999994,186.52425739999995],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"0.25-s","rect":[364.931281,178.02435739999996,388.56950290000003,186.52425739999995],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"gantry","rect":[394.52453283999995,178.02435739999996,418.4432514399999,186.52425739999995],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"rotation;","rect":[424.3447320099999,178.02435739999996,456.41485470999993,186.52425739999995],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"collimation","rect":[462.3851844699999,178.02435739999996,503.1932043699999,186.52425739999995],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"was","rect":[509.09978487999996,178.02435739999996,523.68561328,186.52425739999995],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"120 \u00d7","rect":[529.67974276,178.02435739999996,551.05019134,186.52425739999995],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"0.2 mm for the UHR coronary acquisitions and 144 \u00d7 0.4 mm for","rect":[303.817,168.55546879999994,552.7654711599998,177.05536879999994],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"the high-pitch thoraco-cervical sweep and the 5-min delayed phase","rect":[303.817,159.03558079999993,552.7739710599999,167.53548079999993],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"(QuantumPlus full-spectral mode).","rect":[303.817,149.56669219999992,431.25770068,158.06659219999992],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"After venous access is established, patients are instructed about","rect":[312.3203,140.033222,552.75187136,148.533122],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"scanning steps and the expected sensations from contrast injection.","rect":[303.82039999999995,130.56433339999998,552.7748210899999,139.06423339999998],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"Patients are positioned supine with arms above the shoulders. Arms","rect":[303.82039999999995,121.04444539999997,552.7782210499998,129.54434539999997],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"are placed slightly oblique to reduce superimposition of carotids and","rect":[303.82039999999995,111.52455739999996,552.76462121,120.02445739999996],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"upper mediastinum. The acquisition comprises","rect":[303.82039999999995,102.05566879999996,477.34075856,110.55556879999996],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"\u223c","rect":[479.79382969999995,102.05566879999996,485.61626119999994,110.55556879999996],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"12 s for UHR cor","rect":[485.6128612,102.05225119999999,549.59330848,110.55215119999998],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"-","rect":[549.5925,102.048822,552.7544627999999,110.548722],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"onary imaging,","rect":[303.817,92.524722,359.11989937000004,101.024622],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"\u223c","rect":[362.381311,92.524722,368.2037425,101.024622],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"5 s for automatic table repositioning, and a final","rect":[368.2037425,92.52386329999999,552.7246716400001,101.02376329999998],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"\u223c","rect":[303.817,83.05497469999999,309.6394315,91.55487469999998],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"3-s high-pitch sweep encompassing lungs, breast parenchyma,","rect":[309.6394315,83.05497469999999,552.79012087,91.55487469999998],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"and carotid arteries. The sequence is completed in a single breath-","rect":[303.817,73.52658679999999,552.72297166,82.02648679999999],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"hold; patients are instructed to avoid swallowing. Baseline blood","rect":[303.817,64.05769819999999,552.77142109,72.55759819999999],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"pressure and heart rate are measured before rate-control agents","rect":[303.817,54.53781019999999,552.75612127,63.03771019999999],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":". . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .","rect":[45.8645,694.039,543.7111999999983,703.039],"fontSize":9},{"text":"Table 1","rect":[42.8598,719.494,73.08089999999999,728.494],"fontSize":9},{"text":"Acquisition protocol","rect":[82.0908,719.494,165.2121,728.494],"fontSize":9},{"text":"Section","rect":[45.8645,701.1750219999999,72.50416700000001,709.1749219999999],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"Details","rect":[326.49299210000004,701.1750219999999,351.43668030000003,709.1749219999999],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"Scanner","rect":[45.86450000000002,681.2152714999999,74.07214740000002,689.2151714999999],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"Dual-source photon-counting CT (Naeotom Alpha; Siemens Healthineers\u00ae) with cadmium-telluride detectors; 0.25-s","rect":[134.19139590000003,681.2152714999999,543.7662761499998,689.2151714999999],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"rotation; collimation by phase: 120 \u00d7 0.2 mm for UHR coronary acquisitions and 144 \u00d7 0.4 mm for the high-pitch","rect":[142.18329600000004,669.1994216999999,537.2799572299998,677.1993216999999],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"thoraco-cervical sweep and the 5-min delayed phase (QuantumPlus full-spectral mode).","rect":[142.18329600000004,657.1835719,450.2882446399999,665.1834719],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"Patient positioning","rect":[45.86450000000005,645.2237213999999,111.93327413000004,653.2236214],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"Supine with arms above the shoulders in a slightly oblique position to reduce overlap of carotids and mediastinum;","rect":[134.19139590000006,645.2237213999999,537.66555241,653.2236214],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"baseline BP and HR measured; beta-blockers and/or nitroglycerin as indicated; single breath-hold with instruction","rect":[142.18329600000007,633.2078716,542.7846884200002,641.2077716],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"not to swallow; beam-hardening mitigation with IMAR.","rect":[142.18329600000007,621.1920218,335.33048163000007,629.1919218],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"Acquisition phases","rect":[45.86450000000008,609.2321713,111.44288026000007,617.2320713],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"\u2022","rect":[143.15128390000007,609.2321713,147.79122590000006,617.2320713],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"Non-contrast CAC: lung apices to L3, prospective ECG-triggered.","rect":[151.82317550000008,609.2321713,381.02111049000007,617.2320713],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"\u2022","rect":[143.15128390000007,597.2163215,147.79122590000006,605.2162215000001],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"UHR CCTA: 120 kVp, retrospective ECG-gated, pitch 0.2.","rect":[151.82317550000008,597.2163215,354.51584181,605.2162215000001],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"\u2022","rect":[143.15128390000007,585.2004717000001,147.79122590000006,593.2003717000001],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"High-pitch thoraco-cervical sweep (FLASH):","rect":[151.82317550000008,585.2004717000001,305.9700486400001,593.2003717000001],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"\u2264","rect":[308.1812210000001,585.2004717000001,313.6611525000001,593.2003717000001],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"3.2 s, pitch 3.2, caudo-cranial (lung bases","rect":[313.6611525000001,585.2004717000001,457.7281516400001,593.2003717000001],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"\u2192","rect":[457.7281516400003,585.2004717000001,465.1360590400003,593.2003717000001],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"orbital floor),","rect":[465.1360590400003,585.2004717000001,510.64989011000034,593.2003717000001],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"prospective ECG-triggered.","rect":[151.82317550000008,573.2406212000001,247.68037727000012,581.2405212000001],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"\u2022","rect":[143.15128390000007,561.2247714000001,147.79122590000006,569.2246714000001],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"Late iodine enhancement (LIE, 5 min): heart + breasts, prospective ECG-triggered in diastole.","rect":[151.82317550000008,561.2247714000001,475.9279241400001,569.2246714000001],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"Additional acquisition","rect":[45.86450000000008,549.2089216000002,121.85795007000007,557.2088216000002],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"Low-dose expiratory scan to quantify air-trapping in COPD or in smokers with","rect":[134.1913959000001,549.2089216000002,410.29434457000013,557.2088216000002],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"\u2265","rect":[412.4919171000001,549.2089216000002,417.9718486000001,557.2088216000002],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"20 pack-years.","rect":[417.9718486000001,549.2089216000002,469.4192055000001,557.2088216000002],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"Contrast protocol","rect":[45.86450000000008,537.2490711000002,108.11092191000009,545.2489711000002],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"Three-phase IV injection using iomeprol-400 or iopromide-370:","rect":[134.1913959000001,537.2490711000002,357.91419933,545.2489711000002],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"\u2022","rect":[143.1512839000001,525.2332213000002,147.7912259000001,533.2331213000002],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"Phase 1: 0.7 mL/kg undiluted contrast at 5\u20136 mL/s.","rect":[151.8231755000001,525.2332213000002,333.1177092900001,533.2331213000002],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"\u2022","rect":[143.1512839000001,513.2173715000002,147.7912259000001,521.2172715000003],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"Phase 2: 0.5 mL/kg contrast + 0.5 mL/kg saline at 3\u20134.5 mL/s.","rect":[151.8231755000001,513.2173715000002,369.79805078,521.2172715000003],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"\u2022","rect":[143.1512839000001,501.2575210000003,147.7912259000001,509.2574210000003],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"Phase 3: 50 mL saline.","rect":[151.8231755000001,501.2575210000003,229.88619970000013,509.2574210000003],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"Total for a 70-kg patient: 84 mL (49 mL undiluted + 35 mL mixed phase).","rect":[134.1913959000001,489.24167120000027,388.77621354999997,497.2415712000003],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"Iodine dose","rect":[45.86450000000008,477.22582140000026,86.66239002000009,485.2257214000003],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"\u2248","rect":[134.1913959000001,477.22582140000026,139.67132740000008,485.2257214000003],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"33.6 g (0.48 gI/kg) with iomeprol-400;","rect":[139.67132740000008,477.22582140000026,274.52564170000005,485.2257214000003],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"\u2248","rect":[276.7176143000001,477.22582140000026,282.1975458000001,485.2257214000003],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"31.08 g (0.44 gI/kg) with iopromide-370.","rect":[282.1975458000001,477.22582140000026,426.00454819000015,485.2257214000003],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"Scan parameters","rect":[45.864500000000106,465.26597090000024,104.3173693300001,473.26587090000027],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"Tube potential: 120 kVp for CCTA; 140 kVp for medium-resolution thoraco-cervical acquisitions and the 5-min delayed","rect":[134.19139590000012,465.26597090000024,543.75587628,473.26587090000027],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"phase. Collimation: 120 \u00d7 0.2 mm (UHR CCTA) and 144 \u00d7 0.4 mm (FLASH & LIE). CARE Dose 4D + CARE keV with","rect":[142.18329600000013,453.25012110000023,543.2934820600001,461.25002110000025],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"reference IQ level 64; prospective ECG-triggering for CAC, FLASH, and LIE; retrospective ECG-gating for CCTA;","rect":[142.18329600000013,441.2342713000002,537.8087506200003,449.23417130000024],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"combined DLP","rect":[142.18329600000013,429.2744208000002,193.92824918000014,437.2743208000002],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"\u2248","rect":[196.15062140000015,429.2744208000002,201.63055290000014,437.2743208000002],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"740 mGy\u00b7cm (effective dose","rect":[203.86252500000015,429.2744208000002,303.39408084000013,437.2743208000002],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"\u2248","rect":[305.62925290000015,429.2744208000002,311.1091844000002,437.2743208000002],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"11\u201313 mSv).","rect":[313.3411565000002,429.2744208000002,357.87579981000016,437.2743208000002],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"Image reconstruction","rect":[45.864500000000135,417.2585710000002,120.56516623000012,425.2584710000002],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"\u2022","rect":[143.15128390000012,417.2585710000002,147.79122590000011,425.2584710000002],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"Coronaries: 0.2-mm slices at 0.1-mm intervals, 1024","rect":[151.82317550000013,417.2585710000002,335.98247348000007,425.2584710000002],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"2","rect":[335.962,421.212044,339.441884,426.544544],"fontSize":5.9998},{"text":"matrix, Bv60, QIR level 4, ZeeFree.","rect":[341.688,417.201022,464.85286042,425.20092200000005],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"\u2022","rect":[143.1544817,405.1851722,147.79442369999998,413.18507220000004],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"Thoracic/cervical angiography: 0.4-mm slices at 0.2-mm spacing, 768","rect":[151.8263733,405.1851722,395.40732849999995,413.18507220000004],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"2","rect":[395.376,409.193044,398.855884,414.52554399999997],"fontSize":5.9998},{"text":"matrix.","rect":[401.102,405.182022,425.2376983,413.18192200000004],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"\u2022","rect":[143.15322439999994,393.2221715,147.79316639999993,401.2220715],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"Cine images for cardiac function: 1.5-mm slices, 1-mm interval across 20 cardiac phases (0\u201395%) on a 512 matrix.","rect":[151.82511599999995,393.2221715,543.78181648,401.2220715],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"Spectral","rect":[45.86644049999995,381.2063217,74.39408389999996,389.2062217],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"post-processing","rect":[53.858340599999956,369.1904719,109.64964319999996,377.1903719],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"VMI at 40 keV (contrast amplification) and 70 keV (calcium subtraction); iodine maps for pulmonary perfusion and ECV;","rect":[134.19333639999996,381.2063217,543.7586167699999,389.2062217],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"virtual non-contrast (VNC); iodine\u2013VNC fusion images; pure lumen reconstructions for stenosis quantification.","rect":[142.18523649999997,369.1904719,529.9723890999999,377.1903719],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"Reconstruction","rect":[45.86644049999998,357.23062139999996,99.25777309999998,365.2305214],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"software","rect":[53.858340599999984,345.21477159999995,84.93795209999999,353.2146716],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"ReconCT (syngo.via VB80C).","rect":[134.1933364,357.23062139999996,234.80887869,365.2305214],"fontSize":7.9999},{"text":"BP, blood pressure; CAC, coronary artery calcium; CCTA, coronary CT angiography; COPD, chronic obstructive pulmonary disease; ECG, electrocardiogram; ECV,","rect":[42.8598,325.918044,546.7103038600001,332.917844],"fontSize":6.9998},{"text":"extracellular volume; HR, heart rate; LIE, late iodine enhancement; DLP, dose-length product; UHR, ultra-high resolution; VMI, virtual monoenergetic images.","rect":[42.8598,316.9023016,526.3093867599997,323.9021016],"fontSize":6.9998},{"text":"4","rect":[36.8503,758.449,42.650299999999994,768.449],"fontSize":10},{"text":"C. De Gori","rect":[493.115,758.779022,532.6956343400001,767.2789220000001],"fontSize":8.4999},{"text":"et al.","rect":[535.0705064,758.779022,552.78259802,767.2789220000001],"fontSize":8.4999}],"note":"PDF.js text-content spans with y adjusted by 0.22em, matching the supplied Zotero corpus text metrics on this PDF. Runtime corpus used to verify line geometry; no page text was synthesized."}
